{"version":1,"key":"article:4","content":{"id":4,"title":"1px 有多大","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cde3936f-1b5c-4e0b-ac53-ce1a27d58e96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在有一个灵魂问题，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1px"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的大小是多大?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f92cefee-7ff8-4f15-9764-30e5736a9aad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要回答这个问题，首先要区分两种像素，一种是物理像素(或者称为设备像素)，一种是逻辑像素(或者称为设备独立像素、CSS 像素)，我们讨论的是一个 CSS 像素有多大。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"33e50099-1620-4ede-aba3-6fb9bc54adaf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"屏幕是通过一个个的发光体发出不同的颜色的光让我们看到画面的，这一个个的发光体的大小可以认为是一个物理像素大小。不同的机器像素的密度是不同的，一般我们衡量密度的方法为每英寸上有多少像素(pixel per inch, ppi)，以我的机器为例，我的屏幕分辨率为 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"47825538-2aa0-4d71-9922-bb9473e20434","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2560 \\times 1600"}],"tex":"2560 \\times 1600"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，而我的屏幕尺寸为 13.3 英寸(对角线的长度)，所以我的屏幕的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ppi"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"fdfbf2c1-89fe-4847-9ecb-2bda1d62caf4","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"\\dfrac{\\sqrt{(2560^2 + 1600^2)}}{13.3} = 227 \\text{ppi}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4269ee1c-e97d-484e-add4-030c9431817b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以在我的机器上一个物理像素的长度为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1/ppi = 1/227 = 0.0044"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 英寸。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"130f209a-f920-47f6-aed3-f037fad80366","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那 CSS 像素与物理像素之间有什么关系呢。在比较早以前，1 个 CSS 像素就是一个物理像素的大小，所以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1px"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的计算公式为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1px = 1 /ppi"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2473795e-a759-4c3c-bfcf-be82815549a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是随着苹果提出了 Retina 屏幕的概念，这种屏幕的特点就是高分辨率，在相同的尺寸下具有两倍甚至三倍的像素点，如果这时 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1px"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的计算方式不变的话，随着 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ppi"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的增大，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1px"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就越小，在相同尺寸的高分辨率的屏幕下显示的很小，这十分的不合理，因此我们需要提出一种与设备无关的像素单位，也就是 CSS 像素。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"45b4974f-5c95-4fd1-9310-8b0a4e0dfba7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS 像素与物理像素之间的关系使用 Device Pixel Ratio(dpr) 来定义，它表示一个 CSS 像素长度相当于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dpr"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个物理像素长度，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dpr"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以通过在系统设置里面设置缩放定义（当缩放网页时，修改的也是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dpr"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值）"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1abae8c7-5aa4-43f6-ace4-87178e643744.webp","uuid":"5f90bf04-e5d7-43a7-819c-28e8ab76b5c2","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1abae8c7-5aa4-43f6-ace4-87178e643744.webp","width":720,"collabId":"78806d54-625b-46e7-a47f-8937553c5dad","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"202a2d79-9104-42b2-bb6a-23a51a4cd1f9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我设置的系统缩放为 200%，也就是说 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dpr = 2"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，一个 CSS 像素长度相当于两个物理像素长度，也就是说在我的电脑上 CSS 的长度为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2/227 = 0.0088"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 英寸。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f3e7ebb8-b797-4d07-9584-97e153e5416e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSS 像素的长度在不同的电脑上依据 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ppi"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dpr"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值具有不同的大小，它的计算公式为"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"839d80f5-ebb7-41d0-895e-51734e9dd2fc","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"1\\text{px} = \\dfrac{\\text{dpr}}{\\text{ppi}}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"793cde88-380a-48f5-828b-065d173c3580","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://www.w3.org/TR/CSS2/syndata.html#:~:text=The%20reference%20pixel%20is%20the%20visual%20angle%20of%20one%20pixel%20on%20a%20device%20with%20a%20pixel%20density%20of%2096dpi%20and%20a%20distance%20from%20the%20reader%20of%20an%20arm%27s%20length.","openEdit":false,"collabId":"1c00ec06-eb0f-4ac3-965a-159153099840","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"W3C CSS specification"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 从视觉的角度给出了一个参考长度"}]},{"type":"blockquote","collabId":"fe973311-95af-4e1d-b5c7-6d72664eed35","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f9f76a4e-5f4a-43c5-8583-1be92a07f524","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"he reference pixel is the visual angle of one pixel on a device with a pixel density of 96 DPI and a distance from the reader of an arm’s length."}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"883d06d4-c4fd-4067-9a43-bfb993c2e262","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人在离屏幕一臂之遥的位置看去，一个像素的大小看上去是 1/96 英寸的长度。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"424d2233-332e-4b8d-ae9f-1362121a0511","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是我们靠计算机比较近，一般不会有一臂之长，为了使得人眼看的比较舒服，一个 CSS 像素长度会小于 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"b9df10dc-b06b-41ea-90c4-a368f53527cb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/96"}],"tex":"1/96"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 英寸，我粗略统计不同计算机的 CSS 像素长度一般在 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"6c458eb4-7e5b-4b28-855b-a5c65715ffae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[1/100, 1/130]"}],"tex":"[1/100, 1/130]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"英寸 之间，举几个🌰："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","collabId":"45448342-e5a3-491b-94fc-b88fc012d54e","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"297e9f97-1044-43d5-9156-7b9af87f9d4a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"0044bb70-0f8f-4c9b-887e-eb31f2ba3866","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我的笔记本电脑的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ppi"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"227"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dpr"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 我设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么我的 CSS 像素长度为"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"21548502-105d-4b1e-bd65-c7c32eaf0f9d","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"\\dfrac{2}{227} = \\dfrac{1}{113.5}"}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"8a00b807-1571-426d-9d9a-605c8045ae05","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"10b3fba9-7250-4ebd-824f-ad6b8044bb94","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我的显示器分辨率为 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"e08b6bcd-50fd-4a61-a5a8-0eea50b431d9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2560 \\times 1440"}],"tex":"2560 \\times 1440"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，尺寸为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"27"},{"type":"formatted","text":"寸，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dpr"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以其 CSS 像素长度为为"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"1460438d-1a3c-4726-b5e0-478f7d5545bd","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{(2560^2 + 1440^2)} / (27)} \\approx \\dfrac{1}{109}"}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"107c703a-141e-4ce0-a665-09a6d1dbc5dc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b1f972d5-c9fa-4a9e-be4c-c47ef7bfc803","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"实验室同学的电脑分辨率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","collabId":"7efaa3c8-dd6b-4994-b732-7313f1a85f81","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1920 \\times 1080"}],"tex":"1920 \\times 1080"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，屏幕大小为 15.6寸，推荐系统缩放比为 125%，也就是说 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dpr = 1.25"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，此时它的 CSS 像素长度为"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"6605cd16-f2dc-49d5-958e-d1f0671ab4fb","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"\\dfrac{1.25}{\\sqrt{(1920^2 + 1080^2)} / (15.6)} \\approx \\dfrac{1}{113}"}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"742c0341-5d09-4d76-beb8-534493b494f5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"eee98b1d-8ed5-41b5-8dc1-df3c8cd2aa30","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最新款 MacBook Pro(2021 年)，官网上给出的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ppi = 254"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它们的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dpr = 2"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以它们的 CSS 像素长度为"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"b220178f-0772-4c63-a8cc-73961489d4f5","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"\\dfrac{2}{254} = \\dfrac{1}{127}"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"1ce37dd5-f3f2-4e1b-82fa-e06ae906622f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们使用手机时，手机离我们的距离相比于电脑离我们的距离更加的近，所以手机上的 CSS 像素长度更短，这样我们才会看的更加的舒服，否则太大的话，靠的太近看到的都是一个个像素点，体验感不好。以苹果手机为例，它的 CSS 长度大约为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1/163"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 英寸，大部分的安卓手机是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1 / 160"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 英寸，相差不大。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f54e7246-0b35-4396-aa9e-51cd3ac9008e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可见在不同的机器上一个 CSS 像素长度是不一样的，不过它们都在一定的范围之内，以保证我们在合适的距离之内看的舒服。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"50bfa159-f16a-4b25-8cda-326c3f880725","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在早期，大家都默认一英寸等于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"96px"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，为了延续传统，Web 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1in"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是依据 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"px"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 定义的，始终定义为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1in = 96px"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是我们知道一般 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1px < 1/96 英寸"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此实际上的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1in < 1英寸"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cm"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个单位也是一样，它定义为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1in = 2.54cm"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，同样在网页中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1cm < 1厘米"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以在实际中，我们非常少使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"in"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cm"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 作为单位，因为它的数值不准确，会带来误解。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","collabId":"bdd29b81-615b-445d-8123-cf805b24138f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"69efef7d-9d3f-4cba-86b6-0ab3fd298162","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在网页中，所有的单位最终都会被换算为 px，虽然我们设置的字体大小为 0.25in，但是在实际显示的时候已经被换算为了 px，也就是 24px，我们一般称换后的值为计算值。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8a3581ca-9961-4a9a-873b-3ba04aa8dd4d.webp","uuid":"7fddc99f-ee23-4047-a2ed-451274722769","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8a3581ca-9961-4a9a-873b-3ba04aa8dd4d.webp","width":720,"collabId":"ef3f63f9-8c2e-479d-aead-c90a2cd8323e","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}],"tags":["CSS","px","深入思考"],"bannerBg":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/wallhaven-y8o7yg_6623f0c3-10fb-438f-a676-b04dabfa694c.jpg","createTime":1644891335000,"updateTime":1791474923023},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1791474923023}}